      <title>原神六周年自选限定五星：知乎玩家一句“选牛牛吧”引发的跑图讨论</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/game/post/20260913/%E5%8E%9F%E7%A5%9E%E5%85%AD%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E8%87%AA%E9%80%89%E9%99%90%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%8E%E7%8E%A9%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A5%E9%80%89%E7%89%9B%E7%89%9B%E5%90%A7%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%91%E5%9B%BE%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA/</link>
